From: PupJune2 <PupJune2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO DNS shortcut

Name the secure DNS settings "CromIKO DNS" (Settings > Privacy), and
make them one tap away:

- A "CromIKO DNS" button with a DNS icon next to Bookmarks and
  Downloads in the shortcut row of the new tab page.
- A "CromIKO DNS" item in the app menu, under the Fire button.

Both open the CromIKO DNS settings, where the user turns secure DNS on
or off and picks the provider.

